  "content": "<p>這是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waterskin/comments\" rel=\"nofollow\">水袋（Waterskin）</a>模組的移植版本，作者為 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/blockynoob/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">BlockyNoob</a></p><p>為食物與飲料物品新增提示資訊顯示，呈現「如釘般堅韌（TAN）」的水分數值，外觀風格仿照受歡迎的 AppleSkin 模組的飢餓度/飽和度提示。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_79dd181e-fbb2-48a0-95ad-b6f3b72641b8.png\" width=\"453\" height=\"139\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_3c5b7407-ec47-4573-8077-dbb33e128e55.png\" width=\"451\" height=\"140\"></p><p>依賴模組：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tough-as-nails\" rel=\"nofollow\">如釘般堅韌（Tough as Nails）</a></p>",
